ATTRIBUTION.txt for their sources. House numbers include modified, filtered addresses
from the Overture Maps Foundation's places theme, under CDLA-Permissive-2.0,
Apache-2.0 (Foursquare Open Source Places) and CC0-1.0 (AllThePlaces).
Copyright 2024 Foursquare Labs, Inc. All rights reserved.
See https://docs.overturemaps.org/attribution/ and LICENSES/{CDLA-Permissive-2.0,Apache-2.0}.txt.
The builder includes the licence texts and credit in PLACES-LICENSES.txt in the index.
The country populations in README.md's coverage table come from GeoNames (CC-BY-4.0).

